    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We all love falling-blocks puzzle games, and we all love the (arguably) two most intricate members of the platonic solids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Namely, the dodecahedron and the icosahedron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/47a86f2ffc4e12dc2ff35dbae5b34e99.poster.avif?t=1743940353\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/47a86f2ffc4e12dc2ff35dbae5b34e99.webm?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/47a86f2ffc4e12dc2ff35dbae5b34e99.mp4?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/b8ea33a9c5977690d4e90d3328174fb3.poster.avif?t=1743940353\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/b8ea33a9c5977690d4e90d3328174fb3.webm?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/b8ea33a9c5977690d4e90d3328174fb3.mp4?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psoltrix is the lovechild of Tetris and platonic solids, so these two things never have to be separated again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes, played on a regular dodecahedron and icosahedron, respectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulty settings for every skill level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable game speed without a skill ceiling. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many options to individually adjust the visual representation of the playing field. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional tutorials for an easy introduction to the novel control scheme.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully configurable controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with keyboard and controller. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We all love falling-blocks puzzle games, and we all love the (arguably) two most intricate members of the platonic solids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Namely, the dodecahedron and the icosahedron</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/47a86f2ffc4e12dc2ff35dbae5b34e99.poster.avif?t=1743940353\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/47a86f2ffc4e12dc2ff35dbae5b34e99.webm?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/47a86f2ffc4e12dc2ff35dbae5b34e99.mp4?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/b8ea33a9c5977690d4e90d3328174fb3.poster.avif?t=1743940353\" width=280 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/b8ea33a9c5977690d4e90d3328174fb3.webm?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848000/extras/b8ea33a9c5977690d4e90d3328174fb3.mp4?t=1743940353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psoltrix is the lovechild of Tetris and platonic solids, so these two things never have to be separated again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes, played on a regular dodecahedron and icosahedron, respectively.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulty settings for every skill level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable game speed without a skill ceiling. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many options to individually adjust the visual representation of the playing field. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional tutorials for an easy introduction to the novel control scheme.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully configurable controls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with keyboard and controller. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play Tetris on a regular dodecahedron or icosahedron. The latest development in falling-block technology.",
